meta {
  name: Invitations - Create
  type: http
  seq: 67
}

post {
  url: {{BASE_URL}}/api/v1/communities/nswswk8w8wso0ko8owwk8k0w/invitations
  body: json
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Accept: application/json
  Content-Type: application/json
}

body:json {
  {
    "email": "grace@example.com",
    "role": "member"
  }
}

docs {
  Invites an email address with a role lower than the role of the caller, and sends the invitation email (#1242). The signed link of the email works for 7 days, for an account with this email address only. Inviting the same address again replaces its invitation. A member of the community gives a validation issue. Rate limited (10 per minute).
}
